8caf03fa364fc7d8e87fd554e2c9c88341f", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "text": "# DOCUMENT SIGN OFF\n\n# PREPARER(S):\n\n| Name       | Designation |\n| ---------- | ----------- |\n| Sona Singh |             |\n\n# USER APPROVALS:\n\n| Name         | Designation | Date       | Approval Email               |\n| ------------ | ----------- | ---------- | ---------------------------- |\n| Renu Koirala |             | 27/02/2025 | renu.koirala\\@kumaribank.com |\n\n# DOCUMENT REVISION HISTORY\n\n| Document Version | Change Summary | Date | Requested By | Updated By |\n| ---------------- | -------------- | ---- | ------------ | ---------- |\n|                  |                |      |              |            |\n\n# PROJECT COMPLETION SIGN-OFF\n\n# Service Provider\n\n| Name | Designation | Date | Signature |\n| ---- | ----------- | ---- | --------- |\n|      |             |      |           |\n\n\n# Client\n\n| Name | Designation | Date | Signature |\n| ---- | ----------- | ---- | --------- |\n|      |             |      |           |", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 933, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "0e28a16d-97f5-4871-a704-99e9333e10d0": {"__data__": {"id_": "0e28a16d-97f5-4871-a704-99e9333e10d0", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_name": "Letter_Action_FRS-Kumari_Bank_v1.docx", "filename": "tmpf3wi485d", "page": 4, "document_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804", "chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_3", "chunk_index": 3, "total_chunks": 7, "prev_chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_2", "next_chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_4", "tags": ["new document for testing"], "departments": ["ALL"], "category": "Paper", "ingestion_time": "2025-05-24T11:59:44.246712+00:00", "doc_id": "6b97b7cf-eefe-4617-b414-cdbc5fd5f3f9"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["doc_id"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["doc_id", "file_path", "filename"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "6b97b7cf-eefe-4617-b414-cdbc5fd5f3f9", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_name": "Letter_Action_FRS-Kumari_Bank_v1.docx", "filename": "tmpf3wi485d", "page": 4, "document_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804", "chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_3", "chunk_index": 3, "total_chunks": 7, "prev_chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_2", "next_chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_4", "tags": ["new document for testing"], "departments": ["ALL"], "category": "Paper", "ingestion_time": "2025-05-24T11:59:44.246712+00:00", "doc_id": "6b97b7cf-eefe-4617-b414-cdbc5fd5f3f9"}, "hash": "76758c593d5cf814203a60c869687fd71aefc9a22d3352d9a2d0b41cd7a7e795", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "text": "# Introduction\n\nThis Document outlines the workflow of letter action process that is to be automated using RPA.\n\n# Objective\n\nTo automate Letter action process\n\n# Process Flow\n\n# WC-001: Upload scanned pdf in a folder\n\nThe user will upload the scanned document received from the respective authority regarding action required in the customer\u2019s account (if any), in a designated folder.\n\n# WC-002: OCR and LLM result in a excel file\n\nThe bot will retrieve the uploaded document and process it using Google's Gemini API for OCR. The extracted text will be structured and stored in an Excel file. Once the data extraction is complete, the bot will place the Excel file in a designated folder for review. The assigned user will validate the extracted data, checking for any spelling or formatting errors. Once reviewed, the user will update the Excel file with a predefined prefix. The bot will monitor the folder for prefixed files and proceed with further processing.\n\n# WC-003: Action in CBS View table\n\nThe bot will pick each individual detail from the validated Excel sheet and apply a fuzzy matching algorithm against customer records available in the CBS view table. Using predefined weightage criteria set by the bank, the bot will calculate a similarity score and generate a refined customer match list, which will be stored in an Excel file.\n\n# WC-004: Determine action for the generated result\n\nThe bot will place the final matched records in a designated folder. The concerned user will review the records and specify the required actions for each customer. Once the actions are defined, the user will update the Excel file with a predefined prefix.\n\n# WC-005: Perform action in the CBS\n\nOn the basis of action specified in the excel sheet, the bot will either block/unblock/freeze the accounts of the individual.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1821, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "cb797297-a441-4abb-9fdf-890b59ec74d2": {"__data__": {"id_": "cb797297-a441-4abb-9fdf-890b59ec74d2", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_name": "Letter_Action_FRS-Kumari_Bank_v1.docx", "filename": "tmpf3wi485d", "page": 5, "document_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804", "chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_4", "chunk_index": 4, "total_chunks": 7, "prev_chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_3", "next_chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_5", "tags": ["new document for testing"], "departments": ["ALL"], "category": "Paper", "ingestion_time": "2025-05-24T11:59:44.246728+00:00", "doc_id": "2b0a08c3-84e0-4a69-ae72-9abe113e0e2c"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["doc_id"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["doc_id", "file_path", "filename"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "2b0a08c3-84e0-4a69-ae72-9abe113e0e2c", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_name": "Letter_Action_FRS-Kumari_Bank_v1.docx", "filename": "tmpf3wi485d", "page": 5, "document_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804", "chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_4", "chunk_index": 4, "total_chunks": 7, "prev_chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_3", "next_chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_5", "tags": ["new document for testing"], "departments": ["ALL"], "category": "Paper", "ingestion_time": "2025-05-24T11:59:44.246728+00:00", "doc_id": "2b0a08c3-84e0-4a69-ae72-9abe113e0e2c"}, "hash": "97a724c9c684b2652bb0551703f61dc98bb8c848774dc153750bfe1187975eef", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "text": "If the action requires providing specific customer information, the bot will extract the necessary details, update the Excel file, and forward it to the designated users.\n\n# Flow chart\n\n5", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 187, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "e35f217e-9748-46b2-a85d-f96f79ba5bd0": {"__data__": {"id_": "e35f217e-9748-46b2-a85d-f96f79ba5bd0", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_name": "Letter_Action_FRS-Kumari_Bank_v1.docx", "filename": "tmpf3wi485d", "page": 6, "document_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804", "chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_5", "chunk_index": 5, "total_chunks": 7, "prev_chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_4", "next_chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_6", "tags": ["new document for testing"], "departments": ["ALL"], "category": "Paper", "ingestion_time": "2025-05-24T11:59:44.246734+00:00", "doc_id": "42ccdd71-996e-4692-a936-efe8ff7e0aa1"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["doc_id"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["doc_id", "file_path", "filename"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "42ccdd71-996e-4692-a936-efe8ff7e0aa1", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_name": "Letter_Action_FRS-Kumari_Bank_v1.docx", "filename": "tmpf3wi485d", "page": 6, "document_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804", "chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_5", "chunk_index": 5, "total_chunks": 7, "prev_chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_4", "next_chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_6", "tags": ["new document for testing"], "departments": ["ALL"], "category": "Paper", "ingestion_time": "2025-05-24T11:59:44.246734+00:00", "doc_id": "42ccdd71-996e-4692-a936-efe8ff7e0aa1"}, "hash": "bb7ffcb152f8c26bb47ffcf3c766a67395d5a30b1073934bff8ba4aede6e1716", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "text": "# Current Page\n\n1. Pick the scanned document or the folder\n2. Hit Gemini's API for OCR and LLM\n3. Structure the extracted result and store in excel sheet\n4. Store the excel sheet in the same folder\n5. Read the excel sheet with prefix\n6. Open the excel sheet and read each\n7. Open CBS view Table and apply fuzzy matching algorithm\n8. Calculate the weightage Value\n9. Upload the final result in new excel sheet\n10. Store the file in designated folder\n11. Check the action mentioned each\n12. Perform the action in the CBS\n13. Send the result to the user\n14. End", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 558, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "77ae16bc-4f83-47e8-9630-207f3b7717a8": {"__data__": {"id_": "77ae16bc-4f83-47e8-9630-207f3b7717a8", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_name": "Letter_Action_FRS-Kumari_Bank_v1.docx", "filename": "tmpf3wi485d", "page": 7, "document_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804", "chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_6", "chunk_index": 6, "total_chunks": 7, "prev_chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_5", "next_chunk_id": null, "tags": ["new document for testing"], "departments": ["ALL"], "category": "Paper", "ingestion_time": "2025-05-24T11:59:44.246738+00:00", "doc_id": "370970e5-898b-4e69-a121-3ae645715a74"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["doc_id"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["doc_id", "file_path", "filename"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "370970e5-898b-4e69-a121-3ae645715a74", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_name": "Letter_Action_FRS-Kumari_Bank_v1.docx", "filename": "tmpf3wi485d", "page": 7, "document_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804", "chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_6", "chunk_index": 6, "total_chunks": 7, "prev_chunk_id": "c694241a-5ca5-4ddf-a99c-d75defb1e804_5", "next_chunk_id": null, "tags": ["new document for testing"], "departments": ["ALL"], "category": "Paper", "ingestion_time": "2025-05-24T11:59:44.246738+00:00", "doc_id": "370970e5-898b-4e69-a121-3ae645715a74"}, "hash": "4e3115ab99c95ebb2c1c54e6fea949638c059abad20ce1a8eb80b79e265e2111", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "text": "# Limitation and Constraints\n\nIf the format of the excel sheet is changed, the bot might not give an accurate result.\n\nIf the CBS View table is not updated, the result provided by the bot may not have updated information of new customer list.\n\nIn case the bot fails to perform due to technical error, the bot will send a notification to the concerned set of users.\n\n# Requirements\n\nCBS View table is to be created by the bank and this table is to be updated periodically.\n\nThe bank should provide the weightage for the criteria.\n\nIn case of excelsheet to be sent via email, the bank will have to provide the email ID and provide the email template.\n\nThe bank will have to purchase the Gemini\u2019s API for OCR and LLM extraction.\n\nThe token cost shall be beard by the bank.\n\n# Timeline Estimation\n\nConsidering no changes will be requested in the workflow following is the timeline estimated for the completion of the bot:\n\n| Activity                                     | Week 1 | Week 2 | Week 3 | Week 4 |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ------ | ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| FRS Documentation, SignOff & Access Requests |        |        |        |        |\n| Bot setup and architecture design            |        |        |        |        |\n| Prepare test data for development            |        |        |        |        |\n| Bot Development                              |        |        |        |        |\n| Testing and bug fixing                       |        |        |        |        |\n| UAT test data, UAT release and bug fixing    |        |        |        |        |\n| Production trial runs and bug fixing         |        |        |        |        |\n| Production release                           |        |        |        |        |\n", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1769, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}}, "docstore/metadata": {"185b5f9d-3749-4a1b-8b79-812a359b971b": {"doc_hash": "cc53b632fa048be6172e54d153cd6e498173b9ed2395ccfe4cd378f3adaf1792", "ref_doc_id": "56677478-a10b-421b-a34c-d15d12107177"}, "56677478-a10b-421b-a34c-d15d12107177": {"doc_hash": "cc53b632fa048be6172e54d153cd6e498173b9ed2395ccfe4cd378f3adaf1792"}, "6d130506-51c6-4f5d-9ceb-6710ae7c245f": {"doc_hash": "c43d9c6733b84cb4f14bb6ce542c2f36908f552a46fa7f7e9d30f04979f2a7a0", "ref_doc_id": "9c45f994-8f1e-453e-907c-30a1f3ec430d"}, "9c45f994-8f1e-453e-907c-30a1f3ec430d": {"doc_hash": "c43d9c6733b84cb4f14bb6ce542c2f36908f552a46fa7f7e9d30f04979f2a7a0"}, "60b8773b-3a83-4d69-a450-1c9beba598a6": {"doc_hash": "ec0eef217eeb12dfd52386dcf70e68caf03fa364fc7d8e87fd554e2c9c88341f", "ref_doc_id": "f9b1d741-e1fc-41c0-88fa-3872d671279a"}, "f9b1d741-e1fc-41c0-88fa-3872d671279a": {"doc_hash": "ec0eef217eeb12dfd52386dcf70e68caf03fa364fc7d8e87fd554e2c9c88341f"}, "0e28a16d-97f5-4871-a704-99e9333e10d0": {"doc_hash": "76758c593d5cf814203a60c869687fd71aefc9a22d3352d9a2d0b41cd7a7e795", "ref_doc_id": "6b97b7cf-eefe-4617-b414-cdbc5fd5f3f9"}, "6b97b7cf-eefe-4617-b414-cdbc5fd5f3f9": {"doc_hash": "76758c593d5cf814203a60c869687fd71aefc9a22d3352d9a2d0b41cd7a7e